# --- Coastal Alpine Tech Access Control List ---

# Pattern rule: Sensors can only publish to their unique localized topic namespace
pattern write manakai/soil/%c
pattern read manakai/soil/%c

# AquaGuard Portal can write actuator triggers but cannot listen to general telemetry arrays
user aquaguard_gateway
topic write manakai/actuators/#
topic read manakai/system/status

# Black Box Logger can read absolutely everything across the stack but can never publish a command
user blackbox_harvester
topic read #
